Hands-On Large Language Models - 한국어 번역판 (Korean translation)

This repository is an unofficial Korean translation of
https://github.com/HandsOnLLM/Hands-On-Large-Language-Models
(based on upstream commit ea33908), by Jay Alammar and Maarten Grootendorst,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes made in this translation:
- Markdown cells and code comments in the chapter notebooks were translated into Korean.
  Code, prompts, cell outputs and metadata were left unchanged.
- README.md, bonus/*.md, chapter*/README.md and .setup/ guides were translated into Korean.
- "Open in Colab" links were pointed at this Korean repository.
- A short translation notice was added to each notebook header and to README.md.

